## 👨‍💻 About This Repository

This repository contains the **laboratory assignments, implementations, and solutions** for the **Advanced Data Structures & Algorithms (ADSA)** course as part of the **M.Tech in Data Science & Engineering (DSE)** program at **National Institute of Technology, Jamshedpur**.

The assignments are organized systematically by set to make the repository easy to navigate and maintain throughout the course.

